<title>USA: VideoServer, Tandberg in deal.</title>
<headline>VideoServer, Tandberg in deal.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>VideoServer Inc said Tuesday it entered into a strategic partnership with Tandberg A/S to offer multimedia conferencing and support services to users of conferencing technologies.</p>
<p>Based on the terms of the agreement, Tandberg will resell VideoServer's line of multimedia conference servers. It will also offer support for this new product line.</p>
<p>VideoServer said this partnership formalizes the co-development and sales activities that the two companies have jointly participated in for more than six months.</p>
